From: rhnvrm <hello@rohanverma.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:49:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: batch attachment metadata reads for history pages

Read file metadata through the existing cache in bounded, deduplicated batches.
Keep filtering and preview processing per post, preserve attachment order, and
fall back to ordinary reads on batch errors or preview/metadata retries. Clone
shared file values so mutable metadata stays independent across posts.

Keep single-post, master and deleted-file paths intact. Add ordered history
benchmarks and regressions for missing/repeated IDs, later batch failures,
content limits, hidden posts and pending previews.

Mattermax-Patch: history-file-metadata.patch
